1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
A desert cave hid a library for 900 years.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,400
Follow the old Silk Road west to Dunhuang.

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,800
Monks carved hundreds of caves into the cliff.

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,200
One was sealed and plastered over around 1000 AD.

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,600
Forgotten — until a monk opened it in 1900.

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,000
Inside: 50,000 scrolls in twenty languages.

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,400
Prayers, contracts, songs — a thousand years of voices.

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,800
Double-tap if you'd step into that cave.

10
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:23,800
★ Expert Tip: book Mogao tickets ahead — daily entry is capped.

11
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,200
A library, sealed in sand, waited 900 years.

12
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,600
Follow the route — next stop, the singing sands.
